#: app/api/routes/auth.py:60
msgid ""
"A verification email has been sent. Please verify your email to continue."
" Don't forget to check your spam or junk folder."
msgstr ""
"Se ha enviado un correo electrónico de verificación. Por favor, verifica "
"tu correo electrónico para continuar. No olvides revisar la carpeta de "
"spam o correo no deseado."

